==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|разорити}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*orzoriti}}, from {{af|sla-pro|*orz-|*oriti|nocat=1}}. Compare {{cog|cu|разорити}}, {{cog|sh|разо̀рити}}, {{cog|orv|разорь}}, {{cog|cu|орити}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|разори́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Rominf-разорить.wav}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|разори́ть|pf|impf=разоря́ть}}

# to [[destroy]], to [[ravage]]
# to [[ruin]], to [[bring]] to [[ruin]]

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|4b+p|разори́ть}}

